            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pinkie twinkie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Big hit at outdoor party!\nPut it together early day of, let it marinate 6 hrs.\nNext time will add vidalia/yellow onion to compliment the cuke.\nA different and great way to serve watermelon!",
            "datePublished": "2008-08-23T16:50:37.110Z"
